# --- How to play (F1) --------------------------------------------------------------------------
ui.help.hands.title
* Behind the counter

ui.help.hands.body
* Karolina does the work herself. Click a guest to greet them and take the order; click a table to clear it, a coin to pick up the tip, the sink and hold to wash, swipe a dirt blot to mop it, the jukebox to change the record. Shift+click puts it first in her queue; right-click cancels what she's doing. Keyboard: Enter takes the ticket on the rail ([ ] move), E does the nearest chore (hold E at the sink), G waves, Backspace cancels.

ui.help.brewing.title
* Brewing

ui.help.brewing.body
* The order card shows the wish and up to four recipes (1–4). Quick (Q) lets the machine do it; By hand plays a short mini-game for a better cup. U is the usual for a trusted regular, H hands a wish to a helper, K opens the recipe book. In a mini-game Space holds, arrows steer, Enter is done, Tab skips — a skipped cup is still a good cup. The night slows down while a card is open.

ui.help.duties.title
* Duties (H)

ui.help.duties.body
* Helpers only do what you give them: dishes, floor, register, bar, kitchen, serving. Each can carry one to three duties. Wishes, regulars and the little moments always stay yours.
